(6743378, 1010399, 138253, '<td valign="top">As with several other shots in this challenge, this is a great looking shot, but I do not get the correlation to money from looking at this.<br/>I google''d and closest i could find was a store name peacocks and a company that seems to be a money transfer place....but i don''t think it''s a globally known company, so it will likely be lost on many.<br/>i''d give this a 7 for the image alone, but as i had to put in time to research how this pertains to money I feel that it misses the mark on criteria overall since it''s not readily apparent that peacock = $$$.<br/>4/10.</td>', 'As with several other shots in this challenge, this is a great looking shot, but I do not get the correlation to money from looking at this.I google''d and closest i could find was a store name peacocks and a company that seems to be a money transfer place....but i don''t think it''s a globally known company, so it will likely be lost on many.i''d give this a 7 for the image alone, but as i had to put in time to research how this pertains to money I feel that it misses the mark on criteria overall since it''s not readily apparent that peacock = $$$.4/10.', '2012-04-16 13:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
