(6743496, 1010332, 138253, '<td valign="top">I do like the layers outlining the clock. I think this image would feel otherwise flat without it.<br/>I don''t overly like the lighting, how it''s harsh at the bottom and more natural at the top, makes the wood look worn out and the glass too smudged in the lower half.</td>', 'I do like the layers outlining the clock. I think this image would feel otherwise flat without it.I don''t overly like the lighting, how it''s harsh at the bottom and more natural at the top, makes the wood look worn out and the glass too smudged in the lower half.', '2012-04-16 15:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
