(6743513, 1010361, 138253, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite images in this challenge, even if it''s not the most ''mass appeal popular''. The starkness of the surroundings emphasizes the need to smash this little piggy to bits to get whatever he has inside. Great setup for the shot and works great in B&amp;W.</td>', 'One of my favorite images in this challenge, even if it''s not the most ''mass appeal popular''. The starkness of the surroundings emphasizes the need to smash this little piggy to bits to get whatever he has inside. Great setup for the shot and works great in B&W.', '2012-04-16 15:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6743517, 1010187, 138253, '<td valign="top">America was built on wars and has thrived economically during periods of conflict. Financially, can the country correct it''s current state without more war? Many people think not - though I hope they are wrong.<br/>Sadly, in our world, the ape with the biggest stick is generally the alpha... given that situation, i''d rather be the one holding it, even to never swing it, instead of having it used against me.</td>', 'America was built on wars and has thrived economically during periods of conflict. Financially, can the country correct it''s current state without more war? Many people think not - though I hope they are wrong.Sadly, in our world, the ape with the biggest stick is generally the alpha... given that situation, i''d rather be the one holding it, even to never swing it, instead of having it used against me.', '2012-04-16 15:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
