(6743547, 1010193, 138253, '<td valign="top">Great detail here, and the silver on black really adds to this. I see this finishing high.</td>', 'Great detail here, and the silver on black really adds to this. I see this finishing high.', '2012-04-16 15:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6743548, 1009950, 138253, '<td valign="top">Poor little piggy, doesn''t know what fate is in store for her.</td>', 'Poor little piggy, doesn''t know what fate is in store for her.', '2012-04-16 15:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6743549, 1010375, 138253, '<td valign="top">I think a lot of people will assume you used actual coins and just shot them out of focus - i don''t know if that''s the case or not (as actual currency is not allowed in your shot), but it looks to me more like water sprinkling into a pool (rain/hose, etc).<br/>If it is the latter (or something similar) then I commend you on a good job of making it look like real change. :)</td>', 'I think a lot of people will assume you used actual coins and just shot them out of focus - i don''t know if that''s the case or not (as actual currency is not allowed in your shot), but it looks to me more like water sprinkling into a pool (rain/hose, etc).If it is the latter (or something similar) then I commend you on a good job of making it look like real change. :)', '2012-04-16 15:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6743555, 1010336, 138253, '<td valign="top">Everybody talks about the Sword of Damocles, what people don''t know is that there''s also a Hammer of Damocles - it''s always hanging just above your money.</td>', 'Everybody talks about the Sword of Damocles, what people don''t know is that there''s also a Hammer of Damocles - it''s always hanging just above your money.', '2012-04-16 15:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6743558, 1010263, 138253, '<td valign="top">I like the architecture here</td>', 'I like the architecture here', '2012-04-16 15:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6743559, 1010370, 138253, '<td valign="top">Good representation of the quote.</td>', 'Good representation of the quote.', '2012-04-16 15:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6743560, 1010311, 138253, '<td valign="top">"Lose change here, rage when we don''t give you your stuff"<br/> <br/>I think this could do well in a "faces in places" style challenge as well :)</td>', '"Lose change here, rage when we don''t give you your stuff" I think this could do well in a "faces in places" style challenge as well :)', '2012-04-16 15:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6743561, 1010410, 138253, '<td valign="top">Without the caption i don''t see how this image is representative of money.</td>', 'Without the caption i don''t see how this image is representative of money.', '2012-04-16 15:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6743562, 1010330, 138253, '<td valign="top">I think that focusing in on the chips with the cards beside them would have more of an impact. The overexposure on the cards on the table and the chips leave a lot of questions in the air and are still critical components in connecting these two cards to money.<br/>Nice idea, I just feel it fell a little short of what it was capable of.</td>', 'I think that focusing in on the chips with the cards beside them would have more of an impact. The overexposure on the cards on the table and the chips leave a lot of questions in the air and are still critical components in connecting these two cards to money.Nice idea, I just feel it fell a little short of what it was capable of.', '2012-04-16 15:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6743565, 1010425, 138253, '<td valign="top">Clear image of a nice ring. Definitely makes me think of money when i see it.<br/>I would''ve preferred to have the ring sitting the other up (to get the intended heart effect from the setting) and a little more *oomf* to the background for the ring - it feels a little washed out for my taste.</td>', 'Clear image of a nice ring. Definitely makes me think of money when i see it.I would''ve preferred to have the ring sitting the other up (to get the intended heart effect from the setting) and a little more *oomf* to the background for the ring - it feels a little washed out for my taste.', '2012-04-16 15:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6743568, 1010164, 138253, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t scream "hollywood" to me seeing the image, not knowing the skyline - this could be almost any big city from my perspective.<br/>Even these houses, while i''m sure expensive, feel underwhelming compared to the city in the distance.</td>', 'This doesn''t scream "hollywood" to me seeing the image, not knowing the skyline - this could be almost any big city from my perspective.Even these houses, while i''m sure expensive, feel underwhelming compared to the city in the distance.', '2012-04-16 15:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6743569, 1010101, 138253, '<td valign="top">One of the best examples of using a house to represent money from the images i''ve seen in this challenge.</td>', 'One of the best examples of using a house to represent money from the images i''ve seen in this challenge.', '2012-04-16 15:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6743570, 1010292, 138253, '<td valign="top">Easily recognizable as wealthy/luxurious. Great image.</td>', 'Easily recognizable as wealthy/luxurious. Great image.', '2012-04-16 15:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
