(6744160, 1010292, 101668, '<td valign="top">Well, after reading the threads, I decided to comment on the pictures as if they were all matching. I presume this was also prone to the does nots, in my humble opinion, this symbolises money from the pot filled with happy clivias to the leafless tree behind this magnificent place. Good photography, great composition and love the reflection. Great stuff</td>', 'Well, after reading the threads, I decided to comment on the pictures as if they were all matching. I presume this was also prone to the does nots, in my humble opinion, this symbolises money from the pot filled with happy clivias to the leafless tree behind this magnificent place. Good photography, great composition and love the reflection. Great stuff', '2012-04-17 05:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
