(6747090, 1010382, 128323, '<td valign="top">This is OUTSTANDING!  It''s inspired me to find my hairy friends to see if I can shave parts of them and then take pictures.  I think this shot has a lot of punch and interest, but I don''t quite get why you left the negative space on the right.  Still, awesome shot!</td>', 'This is OUTSTANDING!  It''s inspired me to find my hairy friends to see if I can shave parts of them and then take pictures.  I think this shot has a lot of punch and interest, but I don''t quite get why you left the negative space on the right.  Still, awesome shot!', '2012-04-20 05:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6747091, 1010324, 128323, '<td valign="top">I liked this one as a thumbnail, so I knew it would be awesome when I actually pulled it up.  This tells a great story, and even though I''m not a fan of the "grainy" shots, it works here.  Well done!</td>', 'I liked this one as a thumbnail, so I knew it would be awesome when I actually pulled it up.  This tells a great story, and even though I''m not a fan of the "grainy" shots, it works here.  Well done!', '2012-04-20 05:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
