(6749387, 1010324, 22538, '<td valign="top">Many thanks for all the kind comments. The shot was not planned obviously but I happened to be in the right place at the right time and spotted it a few seconds before everything fell into place.<br/>All the best<br/>armin</td>', 'Many thanks for all the kind comments. The shot was not planned obviously but I happened to be in the right place at the right time and spotted it a few seconds before everything fell into place.All the bestarmin', '2012-04-23 03:22:46.000000', NULL, 0),
