(6749397, 1010186, 16241, '<td valign="top">Cool man, congrats</td>', 'Cool man, congrats', '2012-04-23 03:47:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6749398, 1010075, 141319, '<td valign="top">Thank you everyone for your votes. An interesting distribution of scores ... I was hoping it would do better overall (don''t we always? ;-)), but it was good to see some high scores coming in right at the end - thank you :-)<br/> <br/>Yes, she is doing better, but of course it will take several weeks to heal and many months to be "right" again. <br/> <br/>Good luck with your dog Alona - is it a big dog? The little ones seem to recover much easier from this op.</td>', 'Thank you everyone for your votes. An interesting distribution of scores ... I was hoping it would do better overall (don''t we always? ;-)), but it was good to see some high scores coming in right at the end - thank you :-) Yes, she is doing better, but of course it will take several weeks to heal and many months to be "right" again.  Good luck with your dog Alona - is it a big dog? The little ones seem to recover much easier from this op.', '2012-04-23 03:49:29.000000', NULL, 0),
