(6749487, 1010186, 16912, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by hesitant:</b></div><hr/><i> the money shot - love it </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Means something else to me lol!<br/> <br/>Sorry to hear you ''cheated'' with scotch tape Ken! I''ve cloned all the cards and there was still one active one so thanks for the 5D MKIII ;)<br/> <br/>I collect ''stuff'' as well in the hope I can use it here sometime (currently collecting empty beer cans and whisky bottles).</td>', 'Originally posted by hesitant: the money shot - love it   Means something else to me lol! Sorry to hear you ''cheated'' with scotch tape Ken! I''ve cloned all the cards and there was still one active one so thanks for the 5D MKIII ;) I collect ''stuff'' as well in the hope I can use it here sometime (currently collecting empty beer cans and whisky bottles).', '2012-04-23 07:53:36.000000', NULL, 0),
