(6749491, 1010376, 67258, '<td valign="top">Like Ammie, I don''t get this one - other than the simple connection of goods for purchase, all I see is a shop display of rather ugly slippers.  Ususally, with the benefit of others'' comments I can work out where the photographer was coming from, but not in this case, Bear!</td>', 'Like Ammie, I don''t get this one - other than the simple connection of goods for purchase, all I see is a shop display of rather ugly slippers.  Ususally, with the benefit of others'' comments I can work out where the photographer was coming from, but not in this case, Bear!', '2012-04-23 07:58:10.000000', NULL, 0),
