(6752758, 1010336, 124255, '<td valign="top">5.9''s not a bad score, I gave it a 5 at the time but it is one of those shots I probably could have given 6 easily. Probably not higher though, it''s crisp and snappy but that detail brings out the plastic look of the  bank and the old look of the hammer (they kind of don''t match). The blue dosen''t bother me at all. <br/> <br/>Great idea</td>', '5.9''s not a bad score, I gave it a 5 at the time but it is one of those shots I probably could have given 6 easily. Probably not higher though, it''s crisp and snappy but that detail brings out the plastic look of the  bank and the old look of the hammer (they kind of don''t match). The blue dosen''t bother me at all.  Great idea', '2012-04-26 23:53:07.000000', NULL, 0),
